@mrossinek The problem is that the random interaction does not use residues. It only needs the length of a residue. Ideally, it would only accept the length to avoid confusion that changing a residue would change the result somehow... 
But then it does not conform to the abstract method definition in the Interaction class...

But maybe it is not too bad... (the user is not exposed to this directly and every protein has a residue defined anyway)
